Phase 4 — Features

In: Richer Redis online features; async rebuild from gold in addition to Phase 1 INCR.
Out: Replacing in-request INCR with async-only writers.
Done when: /v1/payments enriches from Redis, not from Spark.

Implementation: FeatureStore materializes customer/merchant/device/agent
hashes on the authorize path after velocity INCR. payment-features-rebuild
rewrites those hashes from Postgres (gold-shaped until the lakehouse exists)
and never writes vel:* keys.
